            "text": "{\"title\":\"Sweet Thai Taro and Coconut Dessert Stew\",\"readyInMinutes\":35,\"servings\":4,\"summary\":\"This sweet Thai dessert stew, known as \u003cb\u003eKaeng Tuat Taro Soup\u003c/b\u003e, blends silky coconut cream with soft purple taro chunks and fragrant pandan leaves. Rooted in traditional Southeast Asian sweet stew techniques, this comforting dish offers a delicate balance of palm sugar richness and warm floral aromas. A subtle pinch of sea salt cuts through the velvety coconut broth, while chewy tapioca pearls add an inviting texture to every spoonful. Perfectly served warm on cool evenings or lightly chilled during hot summer afternoons, this decadent creation brings authentic Bangkok night market flavors directly to your kitchen table. Enjoyed for generations as a post-dinner comfort meal, this stew showcases how humble root vegetables can be transformed into a luxurious sweet treat. The inclusion of fragrant jasmine-infused water enhances the overall aromatic profile without overpowering the natural earthy tones of the taro. Top with toasted sesame seeds or fresh coconut shavings for extra crunch and visual appeal. This recipe is simple to prepare yet yields a deeply satisfying dessert experience that will delight your family.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":380,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":19},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":22,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":34},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":18,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":90},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":46,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":15},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":24,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":27},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":4,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":8},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":0},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":180,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":8},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":5,\"unit\"